building the set.

306
00:11:36,967 --> 00:11:38,300
Keep the credits going!

307
00:11:38,333 --> 00:11:41,333
[WHIRRING]

308
00:11:41,367 --> 00:11:43,500
-My bra strap broke.

309
00:11:43,533 --> 00:11:46,267
[WHIRRING]

310
00:11:46,300 --> 00:11:47,833
-Oh, he's the French
country singer.

311
00:11:47,867 --> 00:11:50,800
