with Guillaume Tubbs.

312
00:11:50,833 --> 00:11:55,467
[WHIRRING]

313
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:58,933
-Hey, he's comin' into
the theater, Mike.

314
00:11:58,967 --> 00:12:01,767
