if we new who the hell he was!

315
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,300
-Mm!.

316
00:12:05,533 --> 00:12:07,067
-Yeah, Arlan H. Bullsh--

317
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:08,400
-OK, OK.

318
00:12:14,633 --> 00:12:16,700
Ah, I had a bottle
of Dom Magwilli once.

319
00:12:16,733 --> 00:12:18,100
It was overrated.

320
00:12:18,133 --> 00:12:19,100
[POP]

321
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,733
(SINGING) Romeo was restless, he
was ready to production design.

322
00:12:33,700 --> 00:12:34,167
[ROCKET BLAST]

323
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:37,167
-Gesundheit.

324
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,300
-Hm?

325
00:12:38,333 --> 00:12:40,367
Creature effects-- hopefully,
this doesn't mean Alf.

326
00:12:44,033 --> 00:12:46,567
