monkey heading at us.

327
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:49,767
[IMITATING A MONKEY]

328
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,233
-I'm gonna ignore this credit.

329
00:12:51,267 --> 00:12:53,633
Just gonna look
away till it's gone.

330
00:12:53,667 --> 00:12:55,100
-It's still there.

331
00:12:55,133 --> 00:12:55,600
You can look.

332
00:12:55,633 --> 00:12:56,100
-OK.

333
00:12:56,133 --> 00:12:57,100
-OK.

334
00:12:57,133 --> 00:13:00,567
[WHIRRING]

335
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,833
Two first names from Van Halen.

336
00:13:02,867 --> 00:13:03,667
Coincidence?

337
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:04,567
-Mm, yes.

338
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,467
-Yeah.

339
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:07,267
-Oh.

340
00:13:07,300 --> 00:13:09,200
Save the Neutrogena bar.

341
00:13:09,233 --> 00:13:12,633
[IMITATING ENGINE]

342
00:13:12,667 --> 00:13:14,867
-This movie is crediting
the entire United

343
00:13:14,900 --> 00:13:16,300
States, person by person!

344
00:13:21,233 --> 00:13:23,367
-Ew, awkward initials.

345
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:23,900
-Yeah.

346
00:13:27,733 --> 00:13:31,067
[HUMMING INTRO MUSIC] Do-da-do.

347
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:34,500
Not a very good tent.

348
00:13:34,533 --> 00:13:36,533
-See, this is what happens
when you de-regulate credits.

349
00:13:40,233 --> 00:13:42,333
Tall, man!

350
00:13:42,367 --> 00:13:43,233
-Yeah.

351
00:13:43,267 --> 00:13:43,767
-Whew.

352
00:13:46,633 --> 00:13:48,500
After making a couple of
rest stops along the way.

353
00:13:51,467 --> 00:13:54,467
-And-- withdrawals
from Earth's banks.

354
00:14:00,133 --> 00:14:02,367
Gerbils, well, they pretty
much remained gerbils.

355
00:14:06,800 --> 00:14:11,500
Questions, please
refer to the addendum.

356
00:14:11,533 --> 00:14:14,600
-And now, ooh, "Heaven is a
Place on Earth," the movie.

357
00:14:19,133 --> 00:14:20,700
-Future Wax.

358
00:14:20,733 --> 00:14:21,633
-Uh, War.

359
00:14:21,667 --> 00:14:22,167
-Oh, yeah.

360
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,133
Heh, heh.
Sorry.

361
00:14:26,033 --> 00:14:27,467
Do-do-do-do-do.

362
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:28,333
Hm?

363
00:14:28,367 --> 00:14:30,500
-Aw, cute little
credits, don't be shy.

364
00:14:30,533 --> 00:14:31,267
Come on up here.

365
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:31,867
-Come on, come on.

366
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:34,133
-Come on up. [KISSES]

367
00:14:34,167 --> 00:14:36,300
-I'm having a secret
storm right now, Mike.

368
00:14:36,333 --> 00:14:37,700
Uh, don't tell anyone.

369
00:14:37,733 --> 00:14:38,233
-OK.

370
00:14:42,567 --> 00:14:45,367
-Three Mile Island
All-inclusive Resort.

371
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:45,900
-Write 'em.

372
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,600
-Ugh, it's tough swimming
in this part of the ocean.

373
00:15:02,367 --> 00:15:02,833
[GROWLING]

374
00:15:02,867 --> 00:15:04,233
-A giant chicken.

375
00:15:04,267 --> 00:15:04,767
