380
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:24,233
-Wow, they lit this
with a KFC heat lamp!

381
00:15:24,267 --> 00:15:26,733
-Chuck Wepner's point of view.

382
00:15:26,767 --> 00:15:31,800
[WHIRRING]

383
00:15:31,833 --> 00:15:35,767
-Later, in Houston, or Portland,
or some crappy hole of a town--

384
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:37,000
-Hey, it's Mike!

385
00:15:37,033 --> 00:15:37,533
Oh, no.

386
00:15:40,633 --> 00:15:42,467
-Santa Claus hits the skids.

387
00:15:42,500 --> 00:15:43,833
-Oh!

388
00:15:43,867 --> 00:15:45,933
-It's kind of an
ineffective beer commercial.

389
00:15:49,967 --> 00:15:51,100
-Give me back my beer!

390
00:15:53,667 --> 00:15:55,433
-Hm?

391
00:15:55,467 --> 00:15:55,933
-Aah!

392
00:15:55,967 --> 00:15:57,600
-Aah!

393
00:15:57,633 --> 00:15:58,567
-Aah!

394
00:15:58,600 --> 00:15:59,100
-Aah!

395
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,367
[YELLING]

396
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:08,433
-Well, I'd better get
back to the office.

397
00:16:08,467 --> 00:16:08,933
[GROWLING]

398
00:16:08,967 --> 00:16:09,933
