399
00:16:09,967 --> 00:16:11,433
Oh.

400
00:16:11,467 --> 00:16:16,233
[CHUCKLES] I warn you,
my meat is very stringy.

401
00:16:16,267 --> 00:16:18,100
[GROWLING]

402
00:16:18,133 --> 00:16:20,233
-This has got be
kinda the last danger

403
00:16:20,267 --> 00:16:21,767
you think of when you're
living in a dumpster.

404
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,300
-Yup!

405
00:16:26,533 --> 00:16:27,533
-He's a Cute-a-saurus.

406
00:16:30,833 --> 00:16:32,900
-Ooh, he's being attacked
by a Schnauzer in a dinosaur

407
00:16:32,933 --> 00:16:34,100
costume.

408
00:16:34,133 --> 00:16:35,000
-Aah!

409
00:16:35,033 --> 00:16:37,100
-Ooh!

410
00:16:37,133 --> 00:16:37,633
-Wow!

411
00:16:37,667 --> 00:16:38,300
Well, that was easy.

412
00:16:38,333 --> 00:16:39,467
-Yeah.

413
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:42,567
-Maybe it was butterflies
that wiped out the dinosaur.

414
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,900
-Tap dogs.

415
00:16:44,933 --> 00:16:46,833
