419
00:16:54,733 --> 00:16:57,833
Must look corrugated and square.

420
00:16:57,867 --> 00:17:00,033
[HUMMING]

421
00:17:00,067 --> 00:17:00,533
-Ooh!

422
00:17:00,567 --> 00:17:01,167
-Thank you.

423
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:07,533
Wow, being a scab
for UPS is hard.

424
00:17:07,567 --> 00:17:11,433
[WHIRRING]

425
00:17:11,467 --> 00:17:13,733
