threatening clown.

427
00:17:23,267 --> 00:17:26,700
-Hey, they got good stuff
here at the police auction.

428
00:17:26,733 --> 00:17:31,133
[WHIRRING]

429
00:17:31,167 --> 00:17:34,133
-Van-damme it!

430
00:17:34,167 --> 00:17:39,100
[WHIRRING]

431
00:17:39,133 --> 00:17:41,400
-Brain Guy looked like
this in high school.

432
00:17:41,433 --> 00:17:41,933
Heh, heh.

433
00:17:49,633 --> 00:17:51,167
-Damn binocular trick.

434
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:51,967
