441
00:18:05,667 --> 00:18:06,133
-Boing!

442
00:18:06,167 --> 00:18:06,667
Boing!

443
00:18:10,367 --> 00:18:12,467
-Oh, he's got clown white
all over his fist now.

444
00:18:16,267 --> 00:18:19,767
-I don't know, maybe they
ship fully inflated balloons

445
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,400
overseas.

446
00:18:20,433 --> 00:18:21,433
[CHUCKLES]

447
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:25,800
-World's grouchiest mime.

448
00:18:28,533 --> 00:18:30,433
-He's "boxed" in.

449
00:18:30,467 --> 00:18:32,333
-Yeah, well, I'm "card-bored."

450
00:18:32,367 --> 00:18:32,833
[CHUCKLES]

451
00:18:32,867 --> 00:18:34,300
-Shut up, you two.

452
00:18:34,333 --> 00:18:35,767
