453
00:18:35,800 --> 00:18:37,967
Be honest, am I wearing
too much eyeliner?

454
00:18:40,667 --> 00:18:41,600
[WHIRRING]

455
00:18:41,633 --> 00:18:44,467
-So he sees considerably
worse than humans.

456
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:47,167
-Hm, hm.

457
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,300
-I like the Randy
Johnson-model cyborg.

458
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:59,133
-The Fed-Ex/DHL wars continued
well into the next century.

459
00:18:59,167 --> 00:18:59,667
