460
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:00,867
-Don't come in yet.

461
00:19:06,267 --> 00:19:08,167
-The truth about
radial keratotomy.

462
00:19:12,033 --> 00:19:12,500
-Hiya!

463
00:19:12,533 --> 00:19:15,433
-Hiya!

464
00:19:15,467 --> 00:19:16,867
-Whoo-wa!

465
00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:18,267
-Cardboard boxes aren't working.

466
00:19:18,300 --> 00:19:22,067
Try throwing a piece of
paper or a cottonball.

467
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:23,433
-Yeow!

468
00:19:23,467 --> 00:19:24,700
-Aah!

469
00:19:24,733 --> 00:19:27,900
This is hard to watch, because
I care about them both so much.

470
00:19:27,933 --> 00:19:29,333
-I care about the boxes.

471
00:19:29,367 --> 00:19:31,800
I mean, why should innocent
freight have to suffer?

472
00:19:37,233 --> 00:19:38,433
-He looks better without makeup.

473
00:19:38,467 --> 00:19:38,933
-Yeah.

474
00:19:38,967 --> 00:19:39,600
He's so pretty.

475
00:19:39,633 --> 00:19:41,667
He really doesn't need it.

476
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:46,833
[GRUNTS AND MOANS]

477
00:19:46,867 --> 00:19:50,933
-Battle of the guys who
peaked in high school.

478
00:19:50,967 --> 00:19:51,867
-Hiya!

479
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:56,467
-[GURGLING]

480
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:57,300
-Ugh!

481
00:19:57,333 --> 00:20:00,467
I got point of
view vertigo, here.

482
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:02,233
-My trained weiner
will finish you off!

483
00:20:07,367 --> 00:20:09,433
-Aah!

484
00:20:09,467 --> 00:20:10,567
-Merengue!

485
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,100
Doo-doo-doo, doo-doo.

486
00:20:15,767 --> 00:20:17,800
-I'll just wait till
you're done twirling, then.

487
00:20:20,667 --> 00:20:22,367
-Hm, hm.

488
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,033
-(YELLING) Packers!

489
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:29,367
-So these guys are
Kung-Fu fighting.

490
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:29,867
[CHUCKLES]

491
00:20:29,900 --> 00:20:33,667
-Da-da da da da.

492
00:20:33,700 --> 00:20:34,433
[OBJECTS CLATTERING]

493
00:20:34,467 --> 00:20:38,133
-My bell collection!

494
00:20:38,167 --> 00:20:39,100
-Aah!

495
00:20:39,133 --> 00:20:40,100
Uh-- ah?

496
00:20:44,967 --> 00:20:47,400
Mama!

497
00:20:47,433 --> 00:20:49,433
-The largest attempt ever
to lock in freshness.

498
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:54,767
-This part was
filmed through soup.

499
00:20:57,800 --> 00:20:59,167
-Hm!

500
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,167
Kim Wilde could do a video here.

501
00:21:04,567 --> 00:21:07,400
I'm all moved in, but I'm
still living out of boxes.

502
00:21:07,433 --> 00:21:11,600
[GROWLING]

503
00:21:11,633 --> 00:21:13,933
-He's using sense memory.

504
00:21:13,967 --> 00:21:17,000
-And actor prepares-- to suck!

505
00:21:17,033 --> 00:21:20,533
-He studied under
Lee Strasberg's car.

506
00:21:20,567 --> 00:21:24,633
-He's read Uta Hagen's "Respect
for Acting-- Like an Imbecile."

507
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:27,467
-Hm, yeah.

508
00:21:27,500 --> 00:21:29,667
You know, he should
probably throw an empty box,

509
00:21:29,700 --> 00:21:31,133
just to keep from getting rusty.

510
00:21:31,167 --> 00:21:32,533
[GROWLING]

511
00:21:37,667 --> 00:21:39,500
-I'm doing the
making-out-with-myself gag,

512
00:21:39,533 --> 00:21:40,967
and no one's here to enjoy it.

513
00:21:43,667 --> 00:21:44,533
[GROWLING]

514
00:21:44,567 --> 00:21:45,700
-Hey, where did I
pack the can opener?

515
00:21:51,267 --> 00:21:53,033
-I continue to remain cold.

516
00:21:57,600 --> 00:21:59,633
-Oh, the warehouse covered
everything in vinyl

517
00:21:59,667 --> 00:22:01,233
so no one sits on
their good boxes.

518
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:08,867
-Hm, do I have something in
my teeth? [MUNCHING SOUNDS]

519
00:22:12,033 --> 00:22:14,333
-All right, there should be
a delay-of-movie penalty,

520
00:22:14,367 --> 00:22:15,367
right about now.

521
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,533
-[WHISTLE] 15 yards.

522
00:22:19,967 --> 00:22:22,000
-Kool-Aid vision!

523
00:22:22,033 --> 00:22:23,200
[GROWLING]

524
00:22:23,233 --> 00:22:24,300
-Nothing, nothing.

525
00:22:24,333 --> 00:22:25,433
I don't hear you, dinosaur.

526
00:22:25,467 --> 00:22:27,100
La, la, la, la, la, la, la.

527
00:22:27,133 --> 00:22:30,200
