528
00:22:30,233 --> 00:22:31,833
-You know, this dinosaur
used to rule Hollywood.

529
00:22:31,867 --> 00:22:34,233
Now Spielberg won't
return his calls.

530
00:22:34,267 --> 00:22:37,433
-Mm, said.

531
00:22:37,467 --> 00:22:37,933
Yeow!

532
00:22:37,967 --> 00:22:40,400
