00:41:21,000 --> 00:41:22,433
-Well, let's do it.

1071
00:41:22,467 --> 00:41:23,467
Right now!

1072
00:41:23,500 --> 00:41:23,967
-Yeah.

1073
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:26,833
Uh, hello, Pearl?

1074
00:41:26,867 --> 00:41:34,067
-Satellite killer
launch, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2--

1075
00:41:34,100 --> 00:41:35,300
-Yeah?

1076
00:41:35,333 --> 00:41:36,667
What?

1077
00:41:36,700 --> 00:41:39,700
-Well, uh, Pearl, uh, I don't
know how else to say this.

1078
00:41:39,733 --> 00:41:41,733
Uh, thank you for
not killing us.

1079
00:41:41,767 --> 00:41:42,233
-Yeah.

1080
00:41:42,267 --> 00:41:42,767
Right!

1081
00:41:47,200 --> 00:41:49,633
-Huh?

1082
00:41:49,667 --> 00:41:51,667
Well, that's OK.

1083
00:41:51,700 --> 00:41:59,967
Ha, ha, I would never kill--
Brain Guy, kid, get over here.

1084
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:00,600
-What?
What?

1085
00:42:00,633 --> 00:42:00,900
What?

1086
00:42:00,933 --> 00:42:01,200
What?

1087
00:42:01,233 --> 00:42:01,800
Oh!

1088
00:42:01,833 --> 00:42:04,733
Hello.

1089
00:42:04,767 --> 00:42:07,500
-Well, you know, things get
pretty tense between us.

1090
00:42:07,533 --> 00:42:09,400
And what with one thing
or another, I mean,

1091
00:42:09,433 --> 00:42:10,933
you could easily have killed us.

1092
00:42:10,967 --> 00:42:12,433
-And you didn't do that.

1093
00:42:12,467 --> 00:42:13,233
So--

1094
00:42:13,267 --> 00:42:14,867
-So, thanks.

1095
00:42:14,900 --> 00:42:15,800
[TAPPING COMPUTER KEYS]

1096
00:42:15,833 --> 00:42:17,033
-Really, that's OK.

1097
00:42:17,067 --> 00:42:21,300
Uh, I guess I just take it for
granted that I would never--

1098
00:42:21,333 --> 00:42:23,600
[TAPPING COMPUTER KEYS]

1099
00:42:23,633 --> 00:42:24,967
-How do you turn the rocket?

1100
00:42:25,000 --> 00:42:26,367
-First you say you
want to kill them.

1101
00:42:26,400 --> 00:42:28,167
Then you say you don't
want to kill to kill them.

1102
00:42:28,200 --> 00:42:28,967
-Well, I--

1103
00:42:29,000 --> 00:42:29,800
-I mean, what am
I supposed to do?

1104
00:42:29,833 --> 00:42:32,033
- --can't kill them now.

1105
00:42:32,067 --> 00:42:33,733
Really, don't think a
second thing about it.

1106
00:42:33,767 --> 00:42:36,033
-Well, we will have to kill
Mike in the box, today.

1107
00:42:36,067 --> 00:42:37,333
Ugh!

1108
00:42:37,367 --> 00:42:39,167
-Um, anything else
you guys want to add?

1109
00:42:39,200 --> 00:42:40,267
-Mm, I don't think so.

1110
00:42:40,300 --> 00:42:42,833
-Just, thanks, for
not killing us.

1111
00:42:42,867 --> 00:42:44,633
-Yeah.

1112
00:42:44,667 --> 00:42:45,967
-Yeah, that's OK.

1113
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:47,033
Don't worry about it.

1114
00:42:47,067 --> 00:42:48,533
-But-- but-- but aren't
you killing them now?

1115
00:42:48,567 --> 00:42:49,600
-Shh!

1116
00:42:49,633 --> 00:42:50,633
-But they're thanking
you for not killing them,

1117
00:42:50,667 --> 00:42:51,400
but you're killing them.

1118
00:42:51,433 --> 00:42:52,100
And they-- ooh!

1119
00:42:52,133 --> 00:42:52,600
Ooh!

1120
00:42:52,633 --> 00:42:53,233
I'm killing.

1121
00:42:53,267 --> 00:42:54,067
[TAPPING ON COMPUTER KEYS]

1122
00:42:54,100 --> 00:42:54,567
-There!

1123
00:42:54,600 --> 00:42:57,267
Ready.

1124
00:42:57,300 --> 00:42:58,867
-Well, I guess that's about it.

1125
00:42:58,900 --> 00:43:00,767
Just, thanks for not--

1126
00:43:00,800 --> 00:43:01,267
