01:28:14,733 --> 01:28:17,533
You've made yourself
into Giant Servo,

2382
01:28:17,567 --> 01:28:18,733
destroyer of whole cities.

2383
01:28:18,767 --> 01:28:21,400
-Uh, Mike, actually,
I'm still over here.

2384
01:28:21,433 --> 01:28:21,967
-Oh.

2385
01:28:22,000 --> 01:28:23,067
Oh, yeah, there you are.

2386
01:28:23,100 --> 01:28:24,300
What, uh--

2387
01:28:24,333 --> 01:28:25,233
[ROARING]

2388
01:28:25,267 --> 01:28:25,733
-Aah!

2389
01:28:25,767 --> 01:28:26,733
Aah!

2390
01:28:26,767 --> 01:28:28,133
It's a giant Servo!

2391
01:28:28,167 --> 01:28:29,100
Run!

2392
01:28:29,133 --> 01:28:30,333
-Help, it's a giant Servo!

2393
01:28:30,367 --> 01:28:30,900
Oh, no!

2394
01:28:30,933 --> 01:28:32,833
A horrible giant Servo!

2395
01:28:32,867 --> 01:28:34,333
Run for your life, Mike!

2396
01:28:34,367 --> 01:28:35,333
-Head for the hills, Mike.

2397
01:28:35,367 --> 01:28:35,867
Run!

2398
01:28:35,900 --> 01:28:37,600
-Aah!

2399
01:28:37,633 --> 01:28:38,433
-Run!

2400
01:28:38,467 --> 01:28:39,167
-Woo hoo!

2401
01:28:39,200 --> 01:28:41,267
That's it, you poor sap.

2402
01:28:41,300 --> 01:28:42,400
-Hoo, we stuck him bad!

2403
01:28:42,433 --> 01:28:43,500
-Oh, man!

2404
01:28:43,533 --> 01:28:44,467
-Good one, Tom.

2405
01:28:44,500 --> 01:28:46,433
Uh, how did you manage
the effects so well?

2406
01:28:46,467 --> 01:28:47,700
-Well, what do you mean?

2407
01:28:47,733 --> 01:28:50,033
-I mean, how do you operate the
other head while you sit there?

2408
01:28:50,067 --> 01:28:52,467
-You know, I was just about
to ask you the same question.

2409
01:28:52,500 --> 01:28:53,333
-Oh, you were?

2410
01:28:53,367 --> 01:28:53,933
-Uh, huh.

2411
01:28:53,967 --> 01:28:54,767
[ROARING]

2412
01:28:54,800 --> 01:28:57,700
-OK, back away very
slowly and run!

2413
01:28:57,733 --> 01:28:59,200
-Ow, ow, ow!

2414
01:28:59,233 --> 01:29:01,267
-Hi, it's me, Tom Servo.

2415
01:29:01,300 --> 01:29:03,400
Don't try to figure it out.

2416
01:29:03,433 --> 01:29:05,000
Hell, I got at
least a dozen of me.

2417
01:29:05,033 --> 01:29:06,933
Uh, Goodnight.

2418
01:29:19,267 --> 01:29:20,233
-Hee, hee, hee, hee.

2419
01:29:20,267 --> 01:29:21,033
Grrr!

2420
01:29:21,067 --> 01:29:21,633
-Whee!

2421
01:29:21,667 --> 01:29:22,333
Fun!

2422
01:29:22,367 --> 01:29:23,967
-Hi, guys.

2423
01:29:24,000 --> 01:29:25,367
Huh!

2424
01:29:25,400 --> 01:29:26,467
Notice anything?

2425
01:29:26,500 --> 01:29:27,633
-Uh, huh, sure, Mike,

2426
01:29:27,667 --> 01:29:28,767
-I'm wearing a funny chin.

2427
01:29:28,800 --> 01:29:29,300
-Uh, look.

2428
01:29:29,333 --> 01:29:31,233
Just stop, would ya?

2429
01:29:31,267 --> 01:29:32,033
-But I can't.

2430
01:29:32,067 --> 01:29:33,233
It's big, and it's funny.

2431
01:29:33,267 --> 01:29:34,400
I have a big chin.

2432
01:29:34,433 --> 01:29:35,367
I have a big chin.

2433
01:29:35,400 --> 01:29:36,500
-Don't you even
care how insulting

2434
01:29:36,533 --> 01:29:37,900
you are to the
thousands of people

2435
01:29:37,933 --> 01:29:40,133
out there who have big,
prosthetic, foam chins?

2436
01:29:40,167 --> 01:29:41,533
-Hm?

2437
01:29:41,567 --> 01:29:42,433
Nope.

2438
01:29:42,467 --> 01:29:43,300
You know why?

2439
01:29:43,333 --> 01:29:45,367
Because I have a big chin!

2440
01:29:45,400 --> 01:29:46,733
Ho, ho, ho, ho.

2441
01:29:46,767 --> 01:29:47,400
It's big.

2442
01:29:47,433 --> 01:29:48,867
-Sorry, everyone.

2443
01:29:48,900 --> 01:29:50,900
Uh, Pearl's calling,
you insensitive cow.

2444
01:29:50,933 --> 01:29:52,200
-Oh, watch this.

2445
01:29:52,233 --> 01:29:52,700
Roar!

2446
01:29:52,733 --> 01:29:55,033
I'll use my chin!

2447
01:29:55,067 --> 01:29:55,967
Ugh!

2448
01:29:56,000 --> 01:29:57,267
Say!

2449
01:29:57,300 --> 01:29:58,667
-Good, good, good, good.

2450
01:29:58,700 --> 01:30:01,500
Results show this film
causes bizarre behavior

2451
01:30:01,533 --> 01:30:03,467
without the use
of hallucinogens.

2452
01:30:03,500 --> 01:30:06,133
Brain Guy, send this
report to the Institute.

2453
01:30:06,167 --> 01:30:07,433
-I don't follow you, my friend.

2454
01:30:07,467 --> 01:30:08,400
No way.

2455
01:30:08,433 --> 01:30:09,567
-We're going on the road.

2456
01:30:09,600 --> 01:30:11,300
-Too true, fair lady.

2457
01:30:11,333 --> 01:30:14,500
Our sound is tight,
you know, mellow?

2458
01:30:14,533 --> 01:30:16,367
Bobo's lyrics are
pure poetry, man!

2459
01:30:16,400 --> 01:30:17,567
-Yes.

2460
01:30:17,600 --> 01:30:20,733
We're opening the Moby Grape
Reunion Tour at Santa Cruz.

2461
01:30:20,767 --> 01:30:21,400
-Oh!

2462
01:30:21,433 --> 01:30:22,367
You are?

2463
01:30:22,400 --> 01:30:23,300
-Um.

2464
01:30:23,333 --> 01:30:24,667
-How nice.

2465
01:30:24,700 --> 01:30:27,933
Well, I have some parting
gifts for both of you.

2466
01:30:27,967 --> 01:30:29,600
These are handmade
love necklaces,

2467
01:30:29,633 --> 01:30:33,033
so as you both have something
special to remember me by.

2468
01:30:33,067 --> 01:30:34,100
-Oh.

2469
01:30:34,133 --> 01:30:36,800
-Pearl, you are too, too
solid for this world, man.

2470
01:30:36,833 --> 01:30:39,500
-Bobo, hit me with some lyrics.

2471
01:30:39,533 --> 01:30:45,667
-(SINGING) Like a duck in
the sand I am yours to--

2472
01:30:45,700 --> 01:30:46,700
[EXPLOSION]

2473
01:30:46,733 --> 01:30:48,400
-Ugh!

2474
01:30:48,433 --> 01:30:49,700
-Now they're eight miles high.

2475
01:30:52,967 --> 01:31:03,000
[THEME MUSIC]

2476
01:31:03,000 --> 01:31:13,000
[THEME MUSIC]

